SUMMARY:Leisure Nature Walk at the Burlington Waterfront! (Patio Dinner af
 ter the Walk)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 **\\*\\*Kindly Read Carefully\\*\\***\n\nPlease join me and my other group
 s on August 16th\; as we enjoy a great Sunday with a fun leisure walk thro
 ugh **Burlington Beach and the Waterfront Trail with other cool gems too.*
 *\n\nWe will meet out side of **Pizzaiolo**\n**1477 Lakeshore Rd.\, Burlin
 gton\, ON L7S 1B5**\n\nThis will give us an opportunity to introduce ourse
 lves as everyone arrives\; then make our way out for our small adventure t
 hrough **some nice walking areas and fun site seeing :)**\n\nSincerely\,\n
 \nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer)\n\n**Event Details:**\n**Leisure Nature Walk
  at the Burlington Waterfront! (Patio Dinner after the Walk)**\n\nIf you h
 aven't been to Burlington Waterfront before now is the time\; and if you h
 ave join us too.\n\n\\*We can stop and rest at different spots\, bathroom 
 breaks\, take some lovely scenic photos\, group shots and share some laugh
 s\n\\*Play a couple new ice breaker games as well to help build some bonds
 \n\\*Great way to make new connections and build upon our existing friends
 hips\n\n\\*Washroom facilities\, water\, beverages\, snacks available ther
 e too :)\n\n\\*Stick around after if you like as we will extend our day to
 gether with dinner and cold beverages on one of the lake side patios\n\\*P
 robably go for Ice Cream after dinner :)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (c
 ash only) when you arrive\nor e transfer in advance to Steveflemming11@gma
 il.com\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\n\n**Time\, Parking and Location: Where to meet us?**\n\n**We will meet
  out side of Pizzaiolo (Pizza place)**\n**1477 Lakeshore Rd.\, Burlington\
 , ON L7S 1B5**\n\n\\*Arrive early if you like (however we will meet out fr
 ont at\n4:00 p.m. (we will wait for everyone to arrive until roughly 4:30 
 p.m.)\n\n**Parking Car when arriving:**\n\\*Park your cars in parking lot 
 or the downtown residential area (lots of places to park)\n\nGo Train will
  take you there by Union Station too :)\n\n\\*If you need a ride (leave a 
 comment below and someone might be in your neighbourhood to give you a lif
 t)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n\n***Thanks for r
 eading everyone\, remember to RSVP and see you real soon!*** :)\n\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
